---
import florBeigeSvg from '../assets/FLOR-BEIGE.svg';
---

<section class="py-16 lg:py-20 bg-brand-burgundy text-white relative overflow-hidden section-border-bottom-dark">
  
  <!-- Decorative background watermarks (feathers on edges) -->
  <div class="absolute -left-16 top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 w-48 lg:w-64 h-auto pointer-events-none select-none opacity-15">
    <img
      src={florBeigeSvg.src}
      alt=""
      class="w-full h-auto object-contain"
      aria-hidden="true"
    />
  </div>

  <div class="absolute -right-16 top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 w-48 lg:w-64 h-auto pointer-events-none select-none opacity-15">
    <img
      src={florBeigeSvg.src}
      alt=""
      class="w-full h-auto object-contain -scale-x-100"
      aria-hidden="true"
    />
  </div>

  <div class="w-full px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 xl:px-10 relative z-10">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto text-center reveal-on-scroll" data-animate="animate__fadeInUp">
      
      <!-- Subtitle -->
      <div class="mb-4">
        <span class="text-xs sm:text-sm font-bold tracking-[0.2em] text-[#ddd2c6] uppercase font-sans">
          VACANTES LIMITADAS
        </span>
      </div>

      <!-- Title -->
      <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-serif font-bold text-white leading-tight mb-6">
        Asegura el lugar de tus hijos en el Colegio Pierre de Coubertin
      </h2>

      <p class="text-white/85 text-base sm:text-lg lg:text-xl font-sans leading-relaxed mb-8 max-w-2xl mx-auto">
        Nuestro equipo de admisiones está a tu disposición para resolver dudas sobre colegiaturas, becas y agendar una visita personalizada a nuestro campus.
      </p>

      <!-- CTAs -->
      <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-center gap-4">
        <a
          href="/#contactos"
          class="w-full sm:w-auto inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2.5 px-8 py-3.5 rounded-full bg-white text-brand-burgundy font-bold text-base hover:bg-[#ece7dc] transition-all duration-200 shadow-lg group focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-white"
        >
          <span>Completar Formulario de Admisión</span>
          <svg class="w-5 h-5 transition-transform duration-200 group-hover:translate-x-1" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="2.5" aria-hidden="true">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M13.5 4.5L21 12m0 0l-7.5 7.5M21 12H3" />
          </svg>
        </a>

        <a
          href="https://wa.me/51999999999?text=Hola,%20deseo%20informaci%C3%B3n%20sobre%20el%20proceso%20de%20admisi%C3%B3n"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="w-full sm:w-auto inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 px-8 py-3.5 rounded-full bg-white/15 text-white font-semibold text-base hover:bg-white/25 border border-white/30 transition-all duration-200 focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-white"
        >
          <span>Escribir por WhatsApp</span>
        </a>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>
